// Shield Chain (PA_SHIELDCHAIN) impacts on the victim: five Shield Boomerang
// clangs, one per thrown shield. The `shield_chain` shader_fx throws one shield
// per hit 0.15s apart, matching the client's damage number stagger, so the
// clangs sit 4.5 frames apart after the same ~5 frame flight. ~1.1s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the victim's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
